 devices/executor. ⚠️Please use at your own risk for potential bans/kick/crashing!​⚠️.\n\n• This script is made specifically in Catalog Avatar Creator for its features to work. The Avatar Copier Feature might still work in other games/experience in some cases as it catch players Wearing Accessories/Clothing/Body that is available on the Roblox Marketplace, and then later Saves them. However❗, please remind yourself that executing this script in other games would pose possible incompatibility/interruption from others running script and can lead to ban/kick/crash❗. Please use with Caution and it is really adviced to use alt/smurfs accounts when running scripts/executor.\n\n• Disclaimer❗: This script keeps players @Username and DisplayName(stored locally or IS NOT shared through link/upload/shared externally) for labeling and properly organizing Avatar properties purposes only(❗Do not try to do what sort of illegal/inappropriate things that would violate players account informations/reputation❗).\n\n• Tested only on Delta Executor and Android Phone Device. Desktops might encounter issues.\n\n• Credits: This script is inspired by a open source Catalog Avatar Creator script created by hi_hi_hi.\n\nFEATURES:\n- Free and no Key Systems\n- Click and Hold to Copy(Any player on the map).\n- Clipboard List of Saved Avatar(will Register any Avatar as long as its modified or even copied from the same player).\n- Supports all accessory/clothings including custom heads, eyelashes, and makeups.\n- Persistent Copied Avatars(Stays Saved even after rejoining, not until Cleared).\n- Minimizable, Dragable, Destroyable UI/Instance.\n- Save Current Wearing Outfit in One Click.\n\nOTHER FEATURES:\n- Duplicate Avatar Copy Prevention.\n- Added UI Protection.\n- Optimized Source Code.\n- Prevent Issues Re-Executing the Script multiple times.\n\nTIPS:\n- Avoid being caught wearing others Avas(Go to map edge or jump high with low gravity or something, dont steal in front of their faces).\n- Comment below if encounter any problem/issues/bug, Im eager to help(Will appreciate if you comment on details).\n- Respect Everyone as always and Use this as a tool to explore Different avatars/accessories, not to violate.\n- Since the Copier can sometimes work in other games, Copy a Avatar then later wear it on Catalog Avatar Creator. (This is not really recommended, Read the Notice above about this matter).\n- Have fun Larping.","tags":["Catalog Avatar Creator","Avatar Copier","Avatar Clipboard","Save Avatars","Free Keyless No Key"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a670c3ff19439ef1f4fbb35","username":"Knightingale","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/638f8365eed879fa2b7c7be5e285ddfc231b1fdc8022370bd42502e3f8b8e017.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a670c3ff19439ef1f4fbb35-1788690309434.jpg"},"lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"6a670c3ff19439ef1f4fbb35","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/638f8365eed879fa2b7c7be5e285ddfc231b1fdc8022370bd42502e3f8b8e017.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a670c3ff19439ef1f4fbb35-1788690309434.jpg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"batus","role":"staff","roleLabel":"ScriptBlox staff","at":"2026-09-04T17:53:55.760Z","profile":"/u/batus"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-21T02:28:30.547Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a97e684b955d13c4a997c60","editBy":{"_id":"6a670c3ff19439ef1f4fbb35","username":"Knightingale","status":"offline","id":"6a670c3ff19439ef1f4fbb35"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-09-02T09:04:04.327Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a9802788bb4308860cfddcf","commentBy":{"_id":"65748a1c06ff53dbd23f193e","username":"hi_hi_hi","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.m